{"chunk_id": "rag-e7d5fdbe3966a920", "source_document": "01绘本编写理念.docx", "source_section": "编写理念", "source_heading": "一、设计理念", "text": "以学习者当前英语水平和认知发展为基础，通过科学分级搭建语言学习阶梯，将教材学习目标融入有趣、连贯的故事情境。通过适量的新语言输入、核心语言复现和真实语境使用，帮助儿童巩固教材所学，拓展语言表达，并逐步发展阅读理解能力与英语语感。\n二、编写思路", "rule_type": "DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "5deb5684407aa874d9325769ed7e4077e08512300a7843c9ea88e14b838ad9ed"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-d5f9faa8ebd37d2c", "source_document": "01绘本编写理念.docx", "source_section": "编写理念", "source_heading": "（一）教材衔接", "text": "分级绘本以 Power Up 教材的单元学习内容为主要依据，与学习者当前课堂学习进度相衔接。\n每个单元综合参考教材的主题、核心词汇、核心句型、语用功能及相关语言知识，在此基础上设计适合儿童阅读的故事情境。\n绘本不机械复述或改写教材原有故事，而是围绕单元主题和学习目标进行新的情境创作，使学习者能够在不同语境中再次接触和使用已学语言，同时获得适量的语言拓展。", "rule_type": "DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "5deb5684407aa874d9325769ed7e4077e08512300a7843c9ea88e14b838ad9ed"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-8d812e99f8b6dd87", "source_document": "01绘本编写理念.docx", "source_section": "编写理念", "source_heading": "（二）分级递进", "text": "绘本依据儿童的认知水平、语言理解能力和语言知识积累进行分级设计，并随着学习进程逐步提高阅读要求。\n认知水平方面，考虑学习者的年龄特点、兴趣、生活经验、思维能力及文化理解；\n语言理解方面，考虑情境理解、信息提取、故事逻辑理解及基础阅读策略；\n语言知识方面，综合考虑词汇量、新词比例、句型复杂度、语法项目、篇幅及语篇结构等因素。\n同一级别的绘本应保持相对稳定的语言难度，同时允许在可理解范围内提供适量的新语言输入。", "rule_type": "LEVEL_READING_GOAL", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "5deb5684407aa874d9325769ed7e4077e08512300a7843c9ea88e14b838ad9ed"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-295c2685de10ba2f", "source_document": "01绘本编写理念.docx", "source_section": "编写理念", "source_heading": "（三）核心语言复现", "text": "分级阅读不仅用于接触新语言，也承担巩固和复现已学语言的功能。\n每篇绘本根据对应单元确定适量的核心词汇、拓展词汇和核心句型。核心语言应在故事中自然出现，并通过不同人物、动作和情境进行有意义的复现，而不是为了达到次数要求进行机械重复。\n已经学习过的重要语言项目还可以在后续绘本中跨故事、跨单元再次出现，形成持续、螺旋式的语言积累。", "rule_type": "RECURRENCE_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "5deb5684407aa874d9325769ed7e4077e08512300a7843c9ea88e14b838ad9ed"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-deee0e3babf3f143", "source_document": "01绘本编写理念.docx", "source_section": "编写理念", "source_heading": "（四）语言真实、自然、可理解", "text": "绘本语言应符合真实生活情境、故事情节逻辑及英语表达习惯，同时与目标学习者的语言水平相适应。\n避免中文思维直译，避免为了套用教材词汇或句型而制造生硬表达，也避免为了增加故事性而使用明显超出目标水平、理解成本过高的表达。\n在存在多个自然表达方式时，优先选择语义透明、儿童易理解、易与故事画面建立对应关系的表达。\n例如，不能只判断单个词是否简单，还应考虑词语组合和构式整体的理解难度。", "rule_type": "PRAGMATIC_NATURALNESS", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "HIGH", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "5deb5684407aa874d9325769ed7e4077e08512300a7843c9ea88e14b838ad9ed"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-53dc68dfe0bf1c7e", "source_document": "01绘本编写理念.docx", "source_section": "编写理念", "source_heading": "（五）内容与事实准确", "text": "涉及自然、科学、健康、安全、文化及生活常识等内容时，应保证事实和情境准确。\n语言简化不能以牺牲事实准确性为代价。对于存在事实风险的内容，应查阅可靠来源进行核验，不直接采用未经验证的 AI 生成信息。\nAI 可以辅助故事创意、语言生成和修改，但最终内容应经过必要的规则校验和人工审核。", "rule_type": "FACTUAL_ACCURACY", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "HIGH", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "5deb5684407aa874d9325769ed7e4077e08512300a7843c9ea88e14b838ad9ed"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-2fbbd6134f545838", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "总述", "source_heading": "教材依据", "text": "本 Demo 以 Cambridge Power Up 2 为教材依据。各单元的主题、核心词汇、核心句型、语法及语言功能构成绘本设计的主要学习依据；分级标准则用于控制篇幅、语言复杂度、新语言比例及阅读理解要求。二者共同确定单篇绘本的内容与语言边界。", "rule_type": "DESIGN_PHILOSOPHY", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-3b35aab76f840f30", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "核心阅读目标", "text": "Level 2 核心阅读目标：情境阅读 · 语言运用：借助图片和上下文理解简短故事；获取人物、时间、地点、活动等基本信息；在不同故事情境中理解并复现教材核心词汇和句型，并尝试使用所学语言描述自己的生活与经历。", "rule_type": "LEVEL_READING_GOAL", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-b4dac960645fd005", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "主题梯度", "text": "Level 2 主题梯度：以儿童熟悉的日常生活与社会交往为主，如家庭生活、学校生活、日常作息、兴趣爱好、游戏、朋友、健康习惯及简单规则等；适当融入合作、分享、尝试、责任等与儿童生活密切相关的成长主题。", "rule_type": "TOPIC_GRADIENT", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-e84d497878171e47", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "文化意识", "text": "Level 2 文化意识：文化发现：在熟悉的儿童生活主题中发现不同国家和地区在日常活动、饮食、游戏、学校生活和节庆方式等方面的简单异同，理解“相同的生活主题可以有不同的表现方式”。", "rule_type": "CROSS_CURRICULAR", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-58c7d55e062a4b39", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "每册阅读量", "text": "Level 2 每册阅读量：120–200 词，平均约 150 词", "rule_type": "LEVEL_READING_GOAL", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": true, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-717c177621f43040", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "句式难度", "text": "Level 2 句式难度：以基本简单句为主，句子结构清晰；可通过替换主语、动词、宾语、地点和时间等成分形成变化，核心句型保持较高复现率。", "rule_type": "LEVEL_READING_GOAL", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-ec182d7180bd1fcb", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "篇章类型", "text": "Level 2 篇章类型：在生活故事和童话基础上，增加简单的描述、介绍和概念说明类文本", "rule_type": "PLOT_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-2c0a6d9105a2be45", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "情节特征", "text": "Level 2 情节特征：具有简单、连续的故事情节，事件关系清晰、较容易预测；可通过重复结构帮助理解故事发展", "rule_type": "PLOT_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-698d4a2a458b2b0f", "source_document": "02分级标准.docx", "source_section": "Level 2", "source_heading": "写作手法", "text": "Level 2 写作手法：以叙事和描述为主，按照时间、空间或事件发展顺序组织信息；可使用简单重复、列举等方式", "rule_type": "WRITING_METHOD", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "9ee285d38819482d66b96e9e809fc235f310579c2c8aac8aba8cae7ecabb9749"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-5b223a91e1645798", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "主题选择原则", "source_heading": "教材衔接", "text": "教材衔接：围绕教材单元的核心主题、语言功能及主要语言项目创设新的故事情境，帮助学习者在阅读中复现和巩固教材所学。故事可以使用教材核心词汇和句型，但不直接复述或模仿教材原有故事情节，应通过新的角色、问题或情境实现语言迁移。", "rule_type": "BOOK_TYPE_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "TEXTBOOK_SYNC", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-ba0d64175866cb79", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "主题选择原则", "source_heading": "主题拓展", "text": "主题拓展：从教材主题出发，进一步拓展其相关的生活经验、行为方式、情感态度和社会认知。同一主题可以从不同角度展开。例如教材涉及“规则”，故事不仅可以表现“遵守规则”，还可以进一步探讨为什么需要规则、规则如何制定、如何共同遵守规则，以及规则在什么情况下可以调整等内容。", "rule_type": "BOOK_TYPE_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "THEME_EXTENSION", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-632a34e53746d9ca", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "主题选择原则", "source_heading": "跨学科提升", "text": "跨学科提升：选择与单元主题自然相关、符合儿童认知水平的文化内容，通过跨学科知识的感知、理解和比较，帮助学习者接触不同学科、文化背景下的认知模式、生活方式、习俗和观念。学科内容可从自然科学、社会科学、人文科学、艺术科学等门类出发，应与故事主题具有真实、明确的联系，优先选择能够自然融入故事的跨学科切入点，避免为了体现“跨学科或跨文化”而进行生硬的对比。", "rule_type": "BOOK_TYPE_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "CROSS_CURRICULAR", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-a4551b1853cf7ec0", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "主题选择原则", "source_heading": "故事方案多样性", "text": "同一单元设计多个故事方案时，应特别关注主题切入点和故事情节的多样性。教材提供的是学习主题和语言依据，而不是故事模板。故事创作不应仅对教材原有情节进行人物、地点或道具替换，而应围绕主题进行合理发散，在保持学习目标关联性的同时形成具有明显差异的故事方案。", "rule_type": "PLOT_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "HIGH", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-75d333df1f2e30d9", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "主题发散示例", "source_heading": "教材衔接", "text": "类型：教材衔接；核心定位：换情境，练所学；与教材的关系：紧密衔接教材主题、核心词汇、句型和语言功能，但不复刻教材故事；故事应该怎么发散：保留“常规日程daily routine”这一学习目标，把教材语言迁移到一个新的儿童生活情境中；情节案例：《My Saturday》：周六没有上学，Mia 原以为自己的 daily routine 全都不一样了。但她发现自己还是会起床、吃早餐、运动、吃午饭、阅读、睡觉，只是时间和活动发生了一些变化。她一边安排自己的周六，一边自然使用 get up, have breakfast, play, read, go to bed 等已学语言。", "rule_type": "BOOK_TYPE_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "TEXTBOOK_SYNC", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-6402e50c95876c61", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "主题发散示例", "source_heading": "主题拓展", "text": "类型：主题拓展；核心定位：从主题出发，进一步思考；与教材的关系：保留教材的大主题，但可以离开教材原有活动和具体语言情境；故事应该怎么发散：从“遵守日程”进一步拓展到“为什么有日程、怎么制定日程、日程能否改变”等儿童能够理解的问题；情节案例：《A Plan for Sunday》：Ben 给星期天制定了满满的日程：8点起床、9点骑车、10点阅读……但突然下雨，原来的安排无法完成。Ben 一开始很着急，后来重新调整计划，把骑车换成室内游戏，也把阅读时间提前。故事让儿童发现：日程帮助我们安排时间，但计划也可以根据实际情况改变。", "rule_type": "BOOK_TYPE_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "THEME_EXTENSION", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-48e9257b3305e880", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "主题发散示例", "source_heading": "跨学科提升", "text": "类型：跨学科提升；核心定位：借主题认识更大的世界；与教材的关系：以教材主题作为入口，引入自然科学、社会科学、人文、艺术等领域的适龄知识；故事应该怎么发散：不只是讲“日程”，而是让儿童发现其他领域也存在类似的节奏、规律、规范或秩序；情节案例：《Who Wakes Up at Night?》：孩子发现自己晚上睡觉时，有些动物才刚刚开始活动。故事跟随孩子的一天，对照猫头鹰、蝙蝠等动物的活动时间：I get up in the morning. The owl wakes up at night. 从人的 daily routine 自然延伸到昼夜节律和动物活动规律，初步认识“不同生物有不同的生活节奏”。", "rule_type": "BOOK_TYPE_GUIDANCE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "CROSS_CURRICULAR", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-3a8fa096f0941329", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇分类与来源", "source_heading": "核心词（CORE", "text": "· 核心词（CORE）:指本篇绘本重点学习、理解和复现的目标词汇。主要来源于当前 Power Up 单元的重点词汇和与单元学习目标密切相关的已学词汇.核心词应与故事主题和主要情节具有较高关联，在文本中自然复现，并能够通过故事情境、人物行动或插图帮助学习者理解和巩固。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-c2e0596b31c92d98", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇分类与来源", "source_heading": "拓展词（EXTENSION", "text": "· 拓展词（EXTENSION）:指教材目标词汇之外，为准确表达故事情节、拓展主题或引入适龄跨学科内容而选择的词汇。拓展词应具有明确的表达价值，原则上优先选择具体、易理解、易通过上下文或画面建立意义联系的词汇，避免为了增加语言丰富度而引入不必要的难词、生僻词或低频表达。拓展词可以成为学习内容，但不要求达到与核心词相同的复现强度。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-f6ae528cc74058d1", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇分类与来源", "source_heading": "复现词（REVIEW", "text": "· 复现词（REVIEW）:指学习者在前序单元、前序级别或已完成绘本中已经接触过，需要在新的故事情境中再次出现的重点词汇。复现的目的不是机械重复，而是让学习者在不同人物、情境和语篇中重新理解和使用已有语言，逐步提高词汇识别和运用的熟练程度。", "rule_type": "RECURRENCE_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REVIEW_RECOMMENDATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-b9f4be4d4e1f039b", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "非目标词汇的处理", "source_heading": "故事创作过程中允许出现少量", "text": "故事创作过程中允许出现少量不属于本篇教学目标、但为自然叙事所需要的词汇。此类词汇应满足以下条件：不构成理解故事主要情节的关键障碍；能够通过插图、上下文或已有知识较容易推断；不需要学习者在本篇中主动掌握；数量应受到控制，避免因追求故事丰富性造成整体语言难度上升。因此，“出现在正文中的词”不等于“需要进入教学词表的词”。AI 生成正文后，如出现未预先规划的内容词，应由系统识别并进入人工审核。教师根据其教学价值判断：值得教 → 纳入 Language Plan，成为 CORE / EXTENSION / REVIEW；不值得教但叙事需要 → 标记为非教学语境词（NON_TEACHING_CONTEXT）；既无教学价值又造成理解负担 → 优先通过 Rewrite 替换或删除。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "HIGH", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-3d3febbfd09162d1", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录补充说明", "source_heading": "1）一词多义", "text": "（1）一词多义原则上按新词义处理。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-fd436a04a4381588", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录补充说明", "source_heading": "2）短语动词", "text": "（2）短语动词及固定搭配原则上作为新的词汇项目处理。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-bbac8e7af101c45c", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录补充说明", "source_heading": "3）合成词", "text": "（3）合成词原则上作为新词处理。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-2366793c6d26b7d1", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录补充说明", "source_heading": "4）派生词", "text": "（4）派生词原则上不自动作为新词处理。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-97669272ef7e6798", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录补充说明", "source_heading": "5）词性转换", "text": "（5）词性转换后核心词义基本不变的，原则上不作为新词处理。", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-b8302fb0c6528f2b", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录标准", "source_heading": "词汇难度判断", "text": "词汇难度不只依据单个词是否出现在教材或既有词表中，还应综合考虑词义、搭配、构式、语境和图文对应关系。\n即使组成表达的单词本身较简单，如果组合后的意义不透明、理解需要较高推断能力，仍应视为潜在语言难点。\n例如：He tips the box over the plate.其中单个词可能并不困难，但 tip + object + over 对低龄英语学习者的意义透明度较低。在不影响故事内容的情况下，可优先改为：He drops the cookies onto the plate.\n因此，低级别绘本应优先采用语义透明、结构清晰、容易与动作和画面建立对应关系的表达。", "rule_type": "PRAGMATIC_NATURALNESS", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE", "VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "HIGH", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-b7ea3aaa3aa8fcde", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录标准", "source_heading": "核心词复现规则", "text": "核心语言应通过故事情节自然复现，而不是为了达到次数要求进行机械重复。\n单篇绘本中，CORE 词原则上应有足够的有效复现（大于等于3），使学习者能够在不同句子或情境中多次接触目标语言；具体次数根据目标级别、篇幅、词汇性质和故事需要确定。\n已学习的重点词汇还应进入历史复现记录，在后续单元和绘本中作为 REVIEW 候选词再次使用，从而形成：首次学习 → 单篇复现 → 跨篇复现 → 跨单元复现的螺旋式词汇积累。复现应优先追求不同语境中的有意义重复。同一句话或同一表达在缺乏情节需要的情况下连续重复，不视为高质量复现。\n分级词汇与篇幅标准\n说明：“6 + 2”等表示单篇建议规划 6 个核心词（CORE）+ 2 个拓展词（EXTENSION）。具体数量可根据故事主题、篇幅及语言需要进行适当调整。拓展词尽量不超出规划数量，核心词尽量贴近规划数量。", "rule_type": "RECURRENCE_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REVIEW_RECOMMENDATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": true, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-8931b51b18e97717", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇收录标准", "source_heading": "词汇复现规则", "text": "单篇内部复现：核心词应在同一本绘本的不同语境中自然复现，具体次数按照对应级别要求执行。拓展词以满足故事表达和理解需要为主，不设置硬性复现次数。\n同级跨册复现：一本绘本中的核心词在完成首次重点学习后，可在同一级别其他绘本中作为复现词（REVIEW）再次出现，实现跨故事、跨情境复现。\n同一核心词在本级不同绘本中的最低覆盖要求为：\nLevel 1–3：至少 3 册；\nLevel 4：至少 4 册；\nLevel 5：至少 5 册；\nLevel 6：至少 6 册。\n跨级别复现：已学核心词可以在后续级别继续进入复现候选池，通过新的主题、情境和语篇持续出现。现阶段暂不设置跨级别最低复现次数的硬性指标。\n跨级别词形与语法递进：词汇复现不局限于完全相同的词形。随着级别提高，可结合相应语法学习进度逐步增加同一词汇的不同形态和结构，例如：Level 1：eat → Level 2：eating → Level 3：ate → 更高级别：have eaten", "rule_type": "RECURRENCE_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REVIEW_RECOMMENDATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": true, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-038e3fd15750278d", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "语句收录标准", "source_heading": "核心句型", "text": "核心句型（CORE PATTERN）：指本篇绘本重点感知、理解和复现的目标句式，主要来源于对应 Power Up 单元的重点句型、语法结构及语言功能。核心句型通常具有相对稳定的结构框架和可替换成分，通过在不同人物、动作和故事情境中的自然复现，使学习者在高频、有意义的语言输入中逐步感知其结构、意义和使用方式。", "rule_type": "PATTERN_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "HIGH", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-7617f3f957db3053", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "语句收录标准", "source_heading": "配套表达", "text": "配套表达（SUPPORTING EXPRESSION）：指围绕核心句型和故事主题，为完成真实交际、推动故事发展而使用的常用表达。配套表达不作为本篇重点操练的固定结构，但应符合目标级别的语言能力，并能够帮助学习者理解核心语言在真实情境中的使用。例如围绕 daily routine，可以出现：", "rule_type": "PATTERN_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-b8b4e72dbd891578", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "语句收录标准", "source_heading": "语篇组织表达", "text": "语篇组织表达（DISCOURSE EXPRESSION）：指用于连接事件、组织故事顺序、表达因果或转折等语篇关系的词语和句式，帮助学习者理解故事发展及句子之间的逻辑关系。低级别以简单、明确的时间和顺序关系为主，如：", "rule_type": "PATTERN_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-94011fb9b5c37a23", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "语句收录标准", "source_heading": "语句项目的组织围绕一个原则", "text": "语句项目的组织围绕一个原则：核心句型的单位不是某一句教材原句，而是“可复用的结构框架 + 交际功能”。", "rule_type": "PATTERN_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "HIGH", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-d72af6da99b4d757", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "语句收录标准", "source_heading": "核心句型按语言结构与语用功能归类", "text": "核心句型按语言结构与语用功能归类，不按具体句子逐条拆分。", "rule_type": "PATTERN_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": false, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-258fad4781d18445", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "分级词汇与篇幅标准", "source_heading": "Level 2词汇原始规则", "text": "级别：Level 2；规划册数：63册；单篇总词数：120–200词；单篇核心词 + 拓展词：8 + 4；本级新增核心词：504词；累计核心词：882词；核心词单篇复现：3–5次；同级跨册复现：≥3册", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "VOCAB_CLASSIFICATION", "REVIEW_RECOMMENDATION"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": true, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-0bfa1833cb29ffe8", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "每册语句数据", "source_heading": "Level 2句型原始规则", "text": "级别：Level 2；每册核心句型：约 2 个；本册复现要求：每个核心句型自然复现 3–5 次；句型变化：可替换 1–2 个元素，如名词、动词、地点、形容词等；句式难度：以“主语 + 谓语”简单句为主，可使用简单陈述句、能力表达、喜好表达及祈使句等", "rule_type": "PATTERN_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "LEVEL_2", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["FULL_TEXT", "REWRITE"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": true, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-af71950cfbfc530f", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "词汇来源占比", "source_heading": "词汇来源占比", "text": "类型：核心词，占比：约 85%，主要来源：Power Up教材每单元核心词汇、拓展词汇；类型：拓展词，占比：约 15%，主要来源：Power Up教材每单元跨学科词汇、文学词汇", "rule_type": "VOCABULARY_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": true, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
{"chunk_id": "rag-709e78a95e4277c9", "source_document": "03语言项目收录标准.docx", "source_section": "语句来源占比", "source_heading": "语句来源占比", "text": "类型：核心句型，占比：约65%，主要来源：Power Up教材每单元规定句型要求；类型：配套表达，占比：约25%，主要来源：围绕Power Up每单元主题、核心句型和故事内容，为完成真实交际、推动故事发展而使用的常用表达；类型：语篇组织，占比：约10%，主要来源：用于连接事件、组织故事顺序、表达因果或转折等语篇关系", "rule_type": "PATTERN_PRINCIPLE", "level_scope": "ALL", "book_type_scope": "ALL", "topic_scope": "ALL", "task_scope": ["PROPOSAL", "FULL_TEXT"], "verification_status": "VERIFIED", "priority": "NORMAL", "non_authoritative_for_runtime_numeric_rules": true, "source_hash": "65aa394d80cf019ee588c1012a9f1faa39619a0959c4ac30e5c2081a2be56db0"}
